    the repayment of loans and the payment of employee benefits, FAW Jilin has disposed a land use right in May 2025. As of June 30,
    2025, there were still US$<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--RepaymentsOfDebt_pn4n6_c20250101__20250630_zM4yKRfVlLE8" title="Repayments of debt" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE9USEVSIENVUlJFTlQgQVNTRVRTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfDebt" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-06-30" id="Fact001301" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">17.85</ix:nonFraction></span> million that have not been received yet.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
  </table>
</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AB_zNxMP3DQS3Fi" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

