    <td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td id="xdx_988_eus-gaap--IntangibleAssetsGrossExcludingGoodwill_iI_pn3n3_c20241231_zgYfQlabMre1" title="Intangible assets, Gross Carrying Amount" style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IntangibleAssetsGrossExcludingGoodwill" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31" id="Fact001438" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">124,560</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td id="xdx_989_eus-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsAccumulatedAmortization_iNI_pn3n3_di_c20241231_zQqC2LopaTti" title="Finite-lived intangible assets, Accumulated Amortization Amount" style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right">(<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsAccumulatedAmortization" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31" id="Fact001440" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">657</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt; text-align: left">)</td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td id="xdx_981_eus-gaap--IntangibleAssetsNetExcludingGoodwill_iI_pn3n3_c20241231_zagr1mxkLZKf" title="Intangible assets, Net Carrying Amount" style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IntangibleAssetsNetExcludingGoodwill" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31" id="Fact001442" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">123,903</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt; text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  </table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A9_z85574y9rQZ7" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ImpairmentOfIntangibleAssetsIndefinitelivedExcludingGoodwill_do_c20250101__20250630_zYWwNAHUly4f" title="Impairment charges recognized on intangible assets"><span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ImpairmentOfIntangibleAssetsIndefinitelivedExcludingGoodwill_do_c20240101__20240630_zhkBBsDlWrO2" title="Impairment charges recognized on intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ImpairmentOfIntangibleAssetsIndefinitelivedExcludingGoodwill" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-06-30" id="Fact001444" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="0" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ImpairmentOfIntangibleAssetsIndefinitelivedExcludingGoodwill" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-06-30" id="Fact001446" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">No</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>
impairment charges were recognized on intangible assets for the six months ended June 30, 2025 and 2024.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Amortization
expenses of intangible assets were US$<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_c20250101__20250630_zm4gTe1bY565" title="Amortization expense of intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-06-30" id="Fact001448" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">4,624</ix:nonFraction></span> and US$<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_c20240101__20240630_zSleCm6hcYGd" title="Amortization expense of intangible assets"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-06-30" id="Fact001450" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">14,091</ix:nonFraction></span> for the six months ended June 30, 2025 and 2024, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact001452" name="CJET:LandUseRightsNetTextBlock"><p id="xdx_807_ecustom--LandUseRightsNetTextBlock_zFSU7qH9ml35" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>10.
<span id="xdx_822_zbdN6etFhEG4">LAND USE RIGHTS, NET</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact001454" name="CJET:ScheduleOfLandUseRightsTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_893_ecustom--ScheduleOfLandUseRightsTableTextBlock_zC79KRo853n9" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Land
use rights consisted of the following:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;<span id="xdx_8B7_zxpIG6S40808" style="display: none">SCHEDULE
OF LAND USE RIGHTS NET</span></span></span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
