<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Goodwill
of US$ <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--Goodwill_iI_pn4n6_uUSD_c20191227_zmNg7mFDKxR8" title="Goodwill"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Goodwill" contextRef="AsOf2019-12-27" id="Fact001609" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.74</ix:nonFraction></span> million represented the excess of the purchase price over the fair value of the net assets acquired as of the Acquisition
Date and was primarily attributable to the expected synergies from integrating FAW Jilin&#8217;s technology into the automotive segment
as well as the acquired workforce. As of June 30, 2025 and December 31, 2024, the goodwill was US$<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--Goodwill_iI_pn4n6_c20250630_ztjETWyKxpvh" title="Goodwill"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Goodwill" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30" id="Fact001611" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.67</ix:nonFraction></span> million and US$<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--Goodwill_iI_pn4n6_c20241231_zKkj9FOVBNR5" title="Goodwill"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Goodwill" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31" id="Fact001613" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.62</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively.
The change was due to foreign currency translation adjustments during the six months ended June 30, 2025. There were <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--GoodwillImpairmentLoss_pn3n3_dxL_c20250101__20250630_z5zhZf0HjRW7" title="Impairment during the period::XDX::-"><span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--GoodwillImpairmentLoss_pn3n3_dxL_c20240101__20241231_zv5rhCiGCj5e" title="Impairment during the period::XDX::-"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl1615"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl1617">no</span></span></span></span> accumulated impairment
losses as of June 30, 2025 and December 31, 2024.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

