</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A3_znKvxoxTAwV" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the six months ended June 30, 2025 and 2024, the Company made cash payments of US$<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DefinedBenefitPlanBenefitObligationBenefitsPaid_pn4n6_c20250101__20250630_zPYigjxW0Ave" title="Cash payments"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanBenefitObligationBenefitsPaid" contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-06-30" id="Fact001843" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">3.72</ix:nonFraction></span> million and US$<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DefinedBenefitPlanBenefitObligationBenefitsPaid_pn4n6_c20240101__20240630_zvpVxJeDY94f" title="Cash payments"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DefinedBenefitPlanBenefitObligationBenefitsPaid" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-06-30" id="Fact001845" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">4.15</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively, to
settle part of the liabilities of the defined benefit plans.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


