<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 30%; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Maturity
    date</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: bottom; width: 70%; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    loans mature gradually from <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDateDescription_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--FAWFinanceCoLtdMember_zxOHzKreaox3" title="Maturity date, description" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_custom_FAWFinanceCoLtdMember" id="Fact002714" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDateDescription">November 1, 2022 to November 1, 2025.</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; background-color: white">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Interest
    Rate and default rate</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    loans bear an annual interest rate of <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--FAWFinanceCoLtdMember_zZjFniwM2Fie" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_FAWFinanceCoLtdMember" id="Fact002716" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.915</ix:nonFraction></span>% and the interest rate for the default principal is <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--FAWFinanceCoLtdMember_zZhvGRqPV9O3" title="Default principal rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateEffectivePercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_FAWFinanceCoLtdMember" id="Fact002718" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">5.0895</ix:nonFraction></span>%</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; background-color: white">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Interest
    expense</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    interest expenses were US$<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_pn4n6_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--FAWFinanceCoLtdMember_zYAnHZjujDMa" title="Interest expense" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_custom_FAWFinanceCoLtdMember" id="Fact002720" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">4.50</ix:nonFraction></span> million and US$<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_pn4n6_c20240101__20240630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--FAWFinanceCoLtdMember_zNxfxgfWxkL3" title="Interest expense" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-06-30_custom_FAWFinanceCoLtdMember" id="Fact002722" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">4.45</ix:nonFraction></span> million for the six months ended June 30, 2025 and 2024 respectively.</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(iii)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
    December 19, 2024, FAW Jilin entered a mortgage loan of US$ <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn4n6_c20241219__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--FAWJilinMember_zOJVuItEZg0d" title="Debt amount" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-19_custom_FAWJilinMember" id="Fact002724" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.39</ix:nonFraction></span> million with FAW Equity Investment (Tianjin) Co., Ltd. The loan
    bears interest of <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20241219__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--FAWJilinMember_z57fiSAeU2df" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-19_custom_FAWJilinMember" id="Fact002726" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3.10</ix:nonFraction></span>% and will mature in one year. As of June 30, 2025, FAW Jilin the mortgaged land use right has been disposed
    to repay the principal.</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(iv)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
    2016, Dezhou Yarui entered into a related party mortgage loan with Dezhou Economic and Tech Development Zone Jingtai Investment Co.,
    Ltd. (&#8220;Dezhou Jingtai&#8221;). The loan was originally due on October 31, 2026. In March 2022, pursuant to the loan agreement,
    Dezhou Jingtai filed a request in court that the Company repay the loan in advance. In April 2022, the Company reached a settlement
    agreement with Dezhou Jingtai. Pursuant to the settlement agreement, the outstanding balance of US$<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--LoansPayable_iI_pn4n6_c20161231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SettlementAgreementMember_z8aZbKHpCVV6" title="Outstanding balance" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LoansPayable" contextRef="AsOf2016-12-31_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_custom_SettlementAgreementMember" id="Fact002728" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">4.62</ix:nonFraction></span> million will bear an annual
    interest rate of <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20161231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SettlementAgreementMember_zmhofwrAQrj" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2016-12-31_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_custom_SettlementAgreementMember" id="Fact002730" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.9</ix:nonFraction></span>% and will be repaid in four installments, with each payment amount of US$<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentPeriodicPayment_pn4n6_c20160101__20161231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zSJp4cjsdYca" title="Installment payments" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPayment" contextRef="From2016-01-012016-12-31_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002732" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.16</ix:nonFraction></span> million on and before August 1,
    2024. As of March 24, 2023, the Company partially paid the first installment, which was due on February 1, 2023. In August 2023,
    Dezhou Yarui entered into an agreement with Dezhou Jingtai to settle the remaining amount due. The following table illustrates the
    carrying amount of the loan and the machine and equipment pledged by the Company to secure the borrowings as of June 30, 2025 and
    December 31, 2024. On August 13, 2025, Dezhou Jingtai applied to the court for the auction of the collateralized assets of Dezhou
    Yarui. The auction process began on August 25, 2025 and has not yet concluded as of September 29, 2025.</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="xdx_30A_134_pn3n3_zVJmEcRAT2kc" summary="xdx: Disclosure - SCHEDULE OF FINANCING WITH RELATED PARTIES (Details)" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
