    <td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: center">US$&#8217;000</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="width: 60%; text-align: center">&#160;</td><td style="width: 2%; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 1%; font-weight: bold; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="width: 16%; font-weight: bold; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>(Unaudited)</b></span></td><td style="width: 1%; font-weight: bold; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="width: 2%">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 1%; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="width: 16%; text-align: center"><b>(Audited)</b></td><td style="width: 1%; text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td><td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="text-align: right">&#160;</td><td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td><td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="text-align: right">&#160;</td><td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr id="xdx_40B_eus-gaap--CollateralizedFinancings_iI_pn3n3_hus-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_ziCW7qFXl0M4" style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="text-align: justify; padding-bottom: 2.5pt">Collateralized by buildings, machinery and equipment, land use right of Dezhou Yarui. The carrying amounts of machinery and equipment pledged to secure the borrowings as of June 30, 2025 and December 31, 2024 were US$<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentNet_iI_c20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_z5c9XdNExu2e" title="Property and equipment" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentNet" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002737" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">606,704</ix:nonFraction></span> and US$<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentNet_iI_c20241231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zKE2q3bwSbei" title="Property and equipment" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentNet" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002739" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">689,814</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively. The carrying amount of buildings and land use rights pledged to secure the borrowings as of June 30, 2025 and December 31, 2024 were US$<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--OtherBorrowings_iI_pn4n6_c20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zaPXRtsQXF4c" title="Borrowings" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002741" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.58</ix:nonFraction></span> million and US$<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--OtherBorrowings_iI_pn4n6_c20241231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zNmZUevk9ZV7" title="Borrowings" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002743" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.22</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively.</td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CollateralizedFinancings" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember" id="Fact002734" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">3,871</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CollateralizedFinancings" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember" id="Fact002735" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">3,799</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt; text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
