<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 30%; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Maturity
    date</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: bottom; width: 70%; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    outstanding balance was due on <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDateDescription_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_zogdG333bx3g" title="Maturity date, description" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember" id="Fact002745" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDateDescription">August 1, 2024</ix:nonNumeric></span>.</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
