    Rate</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    loans bear an annual interest rate of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_zIplwmI7eE99" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember" id="Fact002747" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.9</ix:nonFraction></span>%</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; background-color: white">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Interest
    expense (One loan thus no weighted average rate)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    interest expenses were US$<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_pp0p0_c20250101__20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_zjqZBjcxxGo3" title="Interest expense" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember" id="Fact002749" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">92,905</ix:nonFraction></span> and US$<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--InterestExpense_pp0p0_c20240101__20240630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_zz2SuLxodak" title="Interest expense" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpense" contextRef="From2024-01-012024-06-30_custom_DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember" id="Fact002751" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">93,906</ix:nonFraction></span> for the six months ended June 30, 2025 and 2024 respectively.</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td></tr>
