    the six months ended June 30, 2025, the Company has paid <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--OtherLoansPayable_iI_dxL_c20250630__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--DezhouEconomicAndTechDevelopmentZoneJingtaiInvestmentCoLtdMember_zmCMPNKkqTjc" title="Other payable::XDX::-" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><span style="-sec-ix-hidden: xdx2ixbrl2753">nil</span></span>. </span></td></tr>
