<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(v)
In August and October 2023, Shandong Baoya entered into two loans totaling US$<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromLoans_pp0p0_c20230801__20230831__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zLGvpo5u3NAd" title="Proceeds from loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromLoans_pp0p0_c20231001__20231031__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zcL4LpbEzOHh" title="Proceeds from loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLoans" contextRef="From2023-08-012023-08-31_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002755" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLoans" contextRef="From2023-10-012023-10-31_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002757" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">558,378</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span> with Shandong Jiankangdadi Enterprise Management
Consulting Co., Ltd.(&#8220;Jiankangdadi&#8221;). The loans bear interest of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20231231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zCHi3OK41sgb" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20240423__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zQkkGpHSYqrh" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002759" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-04-23_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002761" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>% and the due dates were on December 31, 2023 and April
23, 2024. As of September 29, 2025, the US$<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromLoans_pn3n3_c20250515__20250515__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember__us-gaap--AwardDateAxis__custom--DecemberThirtyOneTwoThousandTwentyThreeMember_z1nFiU5hEqDg" title="Proceeds from loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLoans" contextRef="From2025-05-152025-05-15_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember_custom_DecemberThirtyOneTwoThousandTwentyThreeMember" id="Fact002763" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">418,784</ix:nonFraction></span> loan had its maturity extended to June 30, 2025 and the interest rate was decreased
to <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250430__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zlxEONQX0FV1" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-04-30_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002765" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6.5</ix:nonFraction></span>%. The due date of the US$<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromLoans_pn3n3_c20251023__20251023__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember__us-gaap--AwardDateAxis__custom--DecemberThirtyOneTwoThousandTwentyThreeMember__srt--StatementScenarioAxis__srt--ScenarioForecastMember_zbXKyK3CN9s" title="Proceeds from loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLoans" contextRef="From2025-10-232025-10-23_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember_custom_DecemberThirtyOneTwoThousandTwentyThreeMember_srt_ScenarioForecastMember" id="Fact002767" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">139,595</ix:nonFraction></span> loan was extended to October 23, 2025, and the interest rate was decreased to <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20251023__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember__srt--StatementScenarioAxis__srt--ScenarioForecastMember_zjQwfkMc5a81" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-10-23_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember_srt_ScenarioForecastMember" id="Fact002769" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6.5</ix:nonFraction></span>%.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


