<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Additionally,
on January 16, 2024, January 19, 2024, and March 25, 2024, Shandong Baoya entered three loans with Jiankangdadi. The loans bear interest
of <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20240119__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zrclB48L0whd" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20240325__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zJz1cDtQHYc4" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-01-19_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002771" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-03-25_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002773" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6.5</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>%. The total of the three loans was US$<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromLoans_pn4n6_c20240116__20240325__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zrpmKmgv0lw1" title="Proceeds from loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLoans" contextRef="From2024-01-162024-03-25_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002775" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.26</ix:nonFraction></span> million, where the due dates are January 15, 2025, January 28, 2025 and March 24, 2025,
respectively. As of September 29, 2025, the due dates were further extended to January 15, 2026, January 28, 2026 and March 24, 2026
with the interest rate of <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250929__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zhvqBTzBsEne" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-29_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002777" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6.5</ix:nonFraction></span>%.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
November 25, 2024, Jiankangdadi filed an application with the Lixia People&#8217;s Court of Jinan City to freeze Shandong Baoya&#8217;s
<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage_iI_dp_uPure_c20241125__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_zkEvnxnepc61" title="Equity ownership percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-11-25_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember" id="Fact002779" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% equity interest in Xiangyang Yazhi equivalent to the outstanding principal of US$<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20241125__srt--OwnershipAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_zFU7jC4P8es6" title="Outstanding debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-11-25_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember83089328" id="Fact002781" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">628,176</ix:nonFraction></span> to secure the borrowings. The freeze order
is effective from November 29, 2024 to November 28, 2027.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(vi)
In August and September 2023, Shandong Baoya entered two loans amounting to US$<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromLoans_pn4n6_c20230801__20230831__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--JinanHaiyunInvestmentConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zVyRUBru4Lz8" title="Proceeds from loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromLoans_pn4n6_c20230901__20230930__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--JinanHaiyunInvestmentConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zwhYgwEyZCP5" title="Proceeds from loans" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLoans" contextRef="From2023-08-012023-08-31_custom_JinanHaiyunInvestmentConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002783" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromLoans" contextRef="From2023-09-012023-09-30_custom_JinanHaiyunInvestmentConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002785" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.40</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span> million with Jinan Haiyun Investment Consulting Co.,
Ltd. The loans bear interest of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20230930__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--JinanHaiyunInvestmentConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember_zEHqtg7NKoG1" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2023-09-30_custom_JinanHaiyunInvestmentConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember" id="Fact002787" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>%. The due dates were February 22, 2024 and March 24, 2024, respectively. As of September 29, 2025,
the due dates were extended to February 22, 2026 and March 24, 2026, respectively. The interest rate was decreased to <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250929__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--JinanHaiyunInvestmentConsultingCoLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAgreementsMember__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zdwtDgt77Cd7" title="Interest rate" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEZJTkFOQ0lORyBXSVRIIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-29_custom_JinanHaiyunInvestmentConsultingCoLtdMember_custom_LoanAgreementsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002789" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">6</ix:nonFraction></span>%.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
December 3, 2024, Jinan Haiyun filed an application with the Lixia People&#8217;s Court of Jinan City to freeze Shandong Baoya&#8217;s
<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage_iI_dp_uPure_c20241203__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_znqu5iRZv27a" title="Equity ownership percentage" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-03_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember" id="Fact002791" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">2</ix:nonFraction></span>% equity interest in FAW Jilin equivalent to the outstanding principal of US$<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn4n6_c20241203__srt--OwnershipAxis__custom--ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember_zVJDBPgoVnn8" title="Outstanding debt" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFJFTEFURUQgUEFSVElFUyAoRGV0YWlscyBOYXJyYXRpdmUpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-03_custom_ShandongJiankangdadiEnterpriseManagementConsultingCoLtdMember83089343" id="Fact002793" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-4" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.54</ix:nonFraction></span> million to secure the borrowings. The freeze order
is effective from December 4, 2024 to December 3, 2027.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

</div></ix:continuation></div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>(d)
Compensation to independent directors</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

